    {
      "id": "hbl-00007",
      "title": "早晨",
      "category": "入门故事",
      "level": "入门",
      "sourceName": "Storybooks HamBaangLaang",
      "sourceUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-hbl/stories/yue/00007/",
      "originalUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00007/00007.mp3",
      "originalPath": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00007.mp3",
      "original": {
        "duration": 171.964,
        "bytes": 2767460,
        "sha256": "eb14f1d8b827806fe16aaa534dd08b71fa4ee3c281652e6ab4cd2370e4a66264"
      },
      "clipPath": "public/listening-audio/hbl-00007-clip.mp3",
      "clip": {
        "duration": 38.088,
        "bytes": 381165,
        "sha256": "8a5a4de2b9320cc8138b5d9c880b4d8dcf7858ff6efcc2ec32f6e221a7ad907b"
      },
      "clipRecipe": {
        "mode": "concat",
        "segments": [
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00007/mp3/02.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00007-02.mp3",
            "text": "今朝起身，媽媽同我講早晨。我都同媽媽講早晨。 媽媽對住我笑。",
            "page": 2
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00007/mp3/03.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00007-03.mp3",
            "text": "喺學校，我見到陳老師。我同陳老師講早晨， 陳老師都同我講早晨，仲讚我乖。",
            "page": 3
          }
        ]
      },
      "transcript": "今朝起身，媽媽同我講早晨。我都同媽媽講早晨。 媽媽對住我笑。\n喺學校，我見到陳老師。我同陳老師講早晨， 陳老師都同我講早晨，仲讚我乖。",
      "transcriptStatus": "source_text",
      "gradingStatus": "not_prepared",
      "attribution": "Written by：IRay Wong, Wong Tk；Read by：山奴",
      "summary": "真人粤语朗读，按完整页面边界选段，可练习事件、人物、顺序和原因。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hbl-00011",
      "title": "我唔明白",
      "category": "入门故事",
      "level": "入门",
      "sourceName": "Storybooks HamBaangLaang",
      "sourceUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-hbl/stories/yue/00011/",
      "originalUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00011/00011.mp3",
      "originalPath": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00011.mp3",
      "original": {
        "duration": 134.661,
        "bytes": 3207755,
        "sha256": "d735bcb68fc0e3beb7015ae8d12364410d5b716cb93639a1ac78cc4f9ad8ef41"
      },
      "clipPath": "public/listening-audio/hbl-00011-clip.mp3",
      "clip": {
        "duration": 45.504,
        "bytes": 455325,
        "sha256": "30931d800c05516aa70e6c2f00cd148b3089a4a391e5e5d5db32cb8320959530"
      },
      "clipRecipe": {
        "mode": "concat",
        "segments": [
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00011/mp3/03.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00011-03.mp3",
            "text": "好似今日上晝噉，爸爸媽媽同我出去玩。 我哋首先搭地鐵，我唔鍾意；",
            "page": 3
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00011/mp3/04.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00011-04.mp3",
            "text": "之後我哋坐船，我唔鍾意；",
            "page": 4
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00011/mp3/05.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00011-05.mp3",
            "text": "跟住我哋轉搭電車，我都唔鍾意；",
            "page": 5
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00011/mp3/06.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00011-06.mp3",
            "text": "後來我哋仲坐小巴同巴士，我全部唔鍾意。",
            "page": 6
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00011/mp3/07.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00011-07.mp3",
            "text": "我鍾意車仔，我問爸爸媽媽點解唔坐車仔，",
            "page": 7
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00011/mp3/08.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00011-08.mp3",
            "text": "爸爸媽媽話要搭公共交通工具，我唔明。",
            "page": 8
          }
        ]
      },
      "transcript": "好似今日上晝噉，爸爸媽媽同我出去玩。 我哋首先搭地鐵，我唔鍾意；\n之後我哋坐船，我唔鍾意；\n跟住我哋轉搭電車，我都唔鍾意；\n後來我哋仲坐小巴同巴士，我全部唔鍾意。\n我鍾意車仔，我問爸爸媽媽點解唔坐車仔，\n爸爸媽媽話要搭公共交通工具，我唔明。",
      "transcriptStatus": "source_text",
      "gradingStatus": "not_prepared",
      "attribution": "Written by：童敬耀, Takki；Read by：Shan",
      "summary": "真人粤语朗读，按完整页面边界选段，可练习事件、人物、顺序和原因。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hbl-00012",
      "title": "同阿仔玩嘅一日",
      "category": "入门故事",
      "level": "入门",
      "sourceName": "Storybooks HamBaangLaang",
      "sourceUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-hbl/stories/yue/00012/",
      "originalUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00012/00012.mp3",
      "originalPath": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00012.mp3",
      "original": {
        "duration": 240.562,
        "bytes": 3849821,
        "sha256": "d5e5ac251951e44a54fb017b46e9bbfded240ba764e84df1ef116f229154a71a"
      },
      "clipPath": "public/listening-audio/hbl-00012-clip.mp3",
      "clip": {
        "duration": 48.792,
        "bytes": 488205,
        "sha256": "d2d9cea325c97e5fbc2f35886db54484bbc05d3292d217b7873dd78c7bce8361"
      },
      "clipRecipe": {
        "mode": "concat",
        "segments": [
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00012/mp3/03.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00012-03.mp3",
            "text": "我哋搭船過海，天氣好好， 海上面有太陽，又有少少雲，天空好靚。",
            "page": 3
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00012/mp3/04.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00012-04.mp3",
            "text": "跟住，我哋搭巴士去沙灘。 我幫阿仔除鞋，先知道佢兩隻襪唔一樣。",
            "page": 4
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00012/mp3/05.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00012-05.mp3",
            "text": "我話：「唔好意思，爸爸幫你着錯襪啊。」",
            "page": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      "transcript": "我哋搭船過海，天氣好好， 海上面有太陽，又有少少雲，天空好靚。\n跟住，我哋搭巴士去沙灘。 我幫阿仔除鞋，先知道佢兩隻襪唔一樣。\n我話：「唔好意思，爸爸幫你着錯襪啊。」",
      "transcriptStatus": "source_text",
      "gradingStatus": "not_prepared",
      "attribution": "Written by：余該隱, Edgar Wong；Read by：山奴",
      "summary": "真人粤语朗读，按完整页面边界选段，可练习事件、人物、顺序和原因。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hbl-00103p",
      "title": "我想要嗰個",
      "category": "入门故事",
      "level": "入门",
      "sourceName": "Storybooks HamBaangLaang",
      "sourceUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-hbl/stories/yue/00103p/",
      "originalUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00103p/00103p.mp3",
      "originalPath": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00103p.mp3",
      "original": {
        "duration": 310.648,
        "bytes": 6468023,
        "sha256": "f7fd689278132e785dfd3393c2deb65e53729f6db88e9541bea6e45a064aac63"
      },
      "clipPath": "public/listening-audio/hbl-00103p-clip.mp3",
      "clip": {
        "duration": 56.64,
        "bytes": 566685,
        "sha256": "0babb4ded3196e94a8cb3b7c6b3900b040baed00bcd14a7bb1123e5fbd8ddc34"
      },
      "clipRecipe": {
        "mode": "concat",
        "segments": [
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00103p/mp3/05.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00103p-05.mp3",
            "text": "媽媽見到仔仔唔開心，諗住同仔仔出去行下。 「嚟啦，阿仔！同媽媽一齊去街市啦！」",
            "page": 5
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00103p/mp3/06.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-00103p-06.mp3",
            "text": "媽媽同仔仔去搵賣生果嘅伯伯。 媽媽諗住買啲蘋果返去。 仔仔見到啲橙，佢望住最下面嗰個話： 「我想要嗰個橙！」 賣生果嘅伯伯鬧佢：「唔准！你隻曳曳豬！ 你一攞走最下面個橙，上面啲橙都會跌落嚟㗎！」",
            "page": 6
          }
        ]
      },
      "transcript": "媽媽見到仔仔唔開心，諗住同仔仔出去行下。 「嚟啦，阿仔！同媽媽一齊去街市啦！」\n媽媽同仔仔去搵賣生果嘅伯伯。 媽媽諗住買啲蘋果返去。 仔仔見到啲橙，佢望住最下面嗰個話： 「我想要嗰個橙！」 賣生果嘅伯伯鬧佢：「唔准！你隻曳曳豬！ 你一攞走最下面個橙，上面啲橙都會跌落嚟㗎！」",
      "transcriptStatus": "source_text",
      "gradingStatus": "not_prepared",
      "attribution": "Written by：Mala Kumar；Read by：Jaime Ho；Translated by：一郎, 阿擇",
      "summary": "真人粤语朗读，按完整页面边界选段，可练习事件、人物、顺序和原因。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hbl-p00015",
      "title": "新雨褸",
      "category": "入门故事",
      "level": "入门",
      "sourceName": "Storybooks HamBaangLaang",
      "sourceUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-hbl/stories/yue/p00015/",
      "originalUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/p00015/p00015.mp3",
      "originalPath": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-p00015.mp3",
      "original": {
        "duration": 206.341,
        "bytes": 2317957,
        "sha256": "252ec377d2a2ca14301564c7a1f06006c27d2c3fca3d54576b0462f8916bc78c"
      },
      "clipPath": "public/listening-audio/hbl-p00015-clip.mp3",
      "clip": {
        "duration": 44.304,
        "bytes": 443325,
        "sha256": "f17494a8f5257a0e328cd5630b05d677ce29a9eeb4fe9fb811c55a4d53f92911"
      },
      "clipRecipe": {
        "mode": "concat",
        "segments": [
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/p00015/mp3/02.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-p00015-02.mp3",
            "text": "星期日，文仔媽媽買咗件新雨褸畀佢。 件雨褸橙紅色，好靚，文仔好想着住佢。 媽媽話：「阿仔，雨褸淨係落雨嗰陣先着㗎咋！」",
            "page": 2
          },
          {
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/p00015/mp3/03.mp3",
            "path": "listening-resources/originals/2026-10-05/hbl-p00015-03.mp3",
            "text": "星期一，天氣好好，太陽好曬。啲花都開得好靚。 文仔問媽媽：「今日會唔會落雨啊？」 媽媽話：「應該唔會喇。」",
            "page": 3
          }
        ]
      },
      "transcript": "星期日，文仔媽媽買咗件新雨褸畀佢。 件雨褸橙紅色，好靚，文仔好想着住佢。 媽媽話：「阿仔，雨褸淨係落雨嗰陣先着㗎咋！」\n星期一，天氣好好，太陽好曬。啲花都開得好靚。 文仔問媽媽：「今日會唔會落雨啊？」 媽媽話：「應該唔會喇。」",
      "transcriptStatus": "source_text",
      "gradingStatus": "not_prepared",
      "attribution": "Written by：Kiran Kasturia；Translated by：一郎",
      "summary": "真人粤语朗读，按完整页面边界选段，可练习事件、人物、顺序和原因。"
    },
